{"id":"503362774","kind":"article","title":"18 后记","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2022-04-23","updated":"2026-10-28","votes":13,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":260,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","学习史","Piotr Wozniak"],"summary":"在间隔重复历史后记中，Piotr Wozniak 回顾写作时才知道间隔重复始于 1985 年 7 月 31 日、如今已有数亿学生使用。他解释写作意图是为未来的网络考古学家留下一份记录，并以诗意的方式回望自己如何在波兰波兹南开启这段历史。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/503362774","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"nnylIyHt\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/The_birthday_of_spaced_repetition:_July_31,_1985\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">诞生于 1985 年 7 月 31 日</a>。当下高达<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Exponential_growth_of_the_popularity_of_Algorithm_SM-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数亿</a>学生在使用间隔重复。我开始动笔时，这两个事实不为我所知。虽有此篇文字描绘间隔重复的来龙去脉，但这段往事可能仍然会在人类历史长河中默默无闻。我谨为未来的网络考古学家撰写此文，以便其描绘真实图景。不过展望不远的未来，智能机器<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Artificial_intelligence_needs_to_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">运转如飞</a> ，而审其现状，或可寻得微毫一脉，溯源第二千年之末，波兰小城波兹南中，一人跌撞踉跄开新河？</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"uR94jzzq\">总目录：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0 目录《间隔重复的历史》</a></p><p data-pid=\"wwurhvmq\">上一章：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"503348150\" href=\"#/post/503348150\">17 成败剖析</a></p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"2k9hQTub\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)#Epilog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">18 Epilog</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复 (spaced repetition) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"305651556\" href=\"#/post/305651556\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"503348150","title":"17 成败剖析","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":20,"minutes":26,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复的历史"},{"id":"20249576882","title":"赫尔曼·艾宾浩斯（1885）与间隔重复（1985）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复的历史"},{"id":"305651556","title":"间隔重复 (spaced repetition)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":38,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}